<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mth, 3-mth BUBOR rate down, 6-mth up.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mth, 3-mth BUBOR rate down, 6-mth up.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) fell on Tuesday for the one and three-month maturities, and rose for six months, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 20.52 percent, down 0.3, the three-month rate at 20.20 percent, down 0.05, and the six-month rate at 19.78, up 0.03.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
